    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Exchanges in a shop",
     "texto": [
      "**Bytte** can mean to exchange a product or to change (transport): **bytte buss** means to change buses.",
      "If a product has no defects, the conditions for exchanging it depend on each shop. The **kvittering** serves as proof of purchase; it does not guarantee that you will get your money back."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
